flowchart LR
    U[Human user] --> C[CLI entry point\npython -m studybot]
    C --> L[Logging + guardrails]
    C --> K[Knowledge loader\nassets/knowledge/*.md|*.txt]
    K --> R[Retriever\nTF-IDF style ranking]
    R --> A[Answer composer\nselects grounded evidence]
    A --> O[Response with sources\nor safe fallback]
    O --> U

    T[Tests / human review] --> K
    T --> R
    T --> A
    T --> O
